-## Architecture note
-
-The large legacy runtime remains in `app/main.js` to limit regression risk. v19.1.0 adds focused helpers and components without attempting a wholesale rewrite. Further feature extraction should proceed incrementally with browser coverage around each moved section.
-
-## Deployment-required validation
-
-The package passes available local syntax, asset, integrity, checksum, and static integration checks. Native iOS/Android PWA behavior, real GPS, live Apps Script/Sheets, horizontal touch behavior, background sync, poor-network recovery, accessibility, and soak tests remain mandatory before race-day rollout.
